# Live build settings.
#
# Vite loads this file for `vite build` (and therefore for `npm run build` and
# `npm run release`), so the shipped bundle carries a room address instead of
# shipping with Multiplayer disabled. The value is a public origin, not a
# secret: it is the same URL the CSP in `public/_headers` allows the page to
# reach, and the same one the room worker allowlists in `MP_ALLOWED_ORIGINS`.
#
# Change both of those in the same commit if the room worker ever moves.
VITE_MULTIPLAYER_URL=https://mca-multiplayer-staging.horsemeninteractive.workers.dev
